{"id":30,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"志学と探究で社会に貢献する高い志を育てる","feature_description":"都立両国高等学校・附属中学校は、質の高い授業と学習習慣の定着を基盤に、世界的視野で国際社会に貢献するリーダーを育成します。職場体験や中学校の卒業研究、高校での探究活動を「志学」と位置づけ、6年間のキャリア教育を実施。英語での発信、理科実験や数学的な論理表現にも力を入れています。中学生は大使館訪問や東京グローバルゲートウェイでの語学研修にも参加し、異文化理解と実践的な英語力を培います。","clubs":[{"id":14708,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/ryogoku-h/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14709,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/ryogoku-h/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14710,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/ryogoku-h/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14711,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/ryogoku-h/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14712,"name":"女子バレー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/ryogoku-h/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14713,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/ryogoku-h/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14714,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/ryogoku-h/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14715,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/ryogoku-h/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14716,"name":"理科部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/ryogoku-h/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14717,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/ryogoku-h/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14718,"name":"管弦楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/ryogoku-h/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14719,"name":"茶華道部","c